### IntelliJ HTTP Client: set accessToken in your PRIVATE environment; never commit a real token.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@courseId = REPLACE_WITH_OWN_COURSE_UUID
@sessionId = REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_UUID
@clientRequestId = REPLACE_WITH_NEW_UUID_AND_KEEP_IT_FOR_RETRY

### Read active; data:null means no active session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-sessions/active
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Start once; replay same body with same clientRequestId -> 200, same session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientRequestId": "{{clientRequestId}}",
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}",
  "timeZone": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh"
}

### Read persisted session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Pause: replace version with latest GET version
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-sessions/{{sessionId}}/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version": 0}

### Resume: replace version with latest GET version
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-sessions/{{sessionId}}/resume
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version": 1}

### Complete only after 25 active minutes; use latest version
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-sessions/{{sessionId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version": 2}

### Cancel an unfinished running/paused session; use latest version
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-sessions/{{sessionId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version": 0}

### History: both terminal statuses, newest endedAt then ID; no active sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-sessions?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Completed only, optionally keep original snapshot courseId even after source deletion
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-sessions?status=COMPLETED&courseId={{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Daily progress: replace date with a day containing your completed sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-sessions/daily?date=2026-10-28&timeZone=Asia%2FHo_Chi_Minh
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Read goal; unsaved default is four sessions, version 0, persisted false
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-goal
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Save goal; replace version with latest GET version
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-goal
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"dailySessions": 6, "version": 0}
